            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">Only a small number of run-of-river power plants are used for the calculation. They were built between 1945 and 1980. The lifetime assumed is 80 years for the dams and 40 for the other materials. The data set describes a mix and is therefore not representative for individual plants.  This dataset is recalculated based on Frischknecht et al. (1996) and Bauer (2007), complemented with data from Axpo (2008).;
